    "featured": [
      {
        "title": "SageMaker Image Classification MLOps",
        "description": "Published by AWS under the aws-samples organization (MIT-0) - an end-to-end, production-shaped MLOps pipeline for image classification on Amazon SageMaker, declared entirely in Terraform across 85 files and 13 reusable modules. Event-driven ingestion, multi-architecture training behind hard clinical quality gates, human-approved governed deployment, and a closed drift-to-retrain loop. The worked example classifies medical images, but the architecture is domain-agnostic.",
